# Stripe Payment Links — deprecated on this static site.
# Checkout now lives on linx.photos (`/apps/instalay`). Configure Stripe there:
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY / STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
#   or PUBLIC_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK_YEARLY / _LIFETIME

# Optional publishable key if you later embed Elements
# VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...

# GitHub Pages base — /InstaLay/ for project Pages (must match repo name).
# GITHUB_PAGES_BASE=/InstaLay/
